  "description": "Host-neutral long-range barcode reading engine behind the Shiny CameraView long-range analyzer — a structure-tensor locator that finds barcode texture in a luminance plane, oriented multi-scanline sampling with sub-pixel edges, blur-tolerant edge-to-similar-edge decoders for EAN-13/UPC-A/EAN-8/UPC-E/Code 128/Code 39/ITF with cross-scanline voting and digit fusion, a frame-to-frame tracker, crop planning for native 2D decoders and an auto-zoom controller.",
